tPurchasesManagerhasEntitlementfor-docpurchasekitRKPurchaseKitdocumentationRKPurchaseKitPurchasesManagerentitlementProductIDs","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"7-Work-with-subscriptions-groups","type":"heading","text":"7  Work with subscriptions (groups)","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List all active auto-renewable subscriptions:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let active = await PurchasesManager.shared.activeSubscriptions()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select the best (latest-expiring) subscription in a group:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if let subscription = await PurchasesManager.shared.activeSubscription(inGroup: \"com.myapp.subscriptions.premium\") {","    print(\"Active plan:\", subscription.displayName)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Where to get groupID?","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It’s available on the product as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"StoreProduct\/subscriptionGroupID (derived from Product.subscription.subscriptionGroupID) and configured in App Store Connect."}]},{"anchor":"See-docpurchasekitRKPurchaseKitdocumentationRKPurchaseKitPurchasesManageractiveSubscriptions-docpurchasekitRKPurchaseKitdocumentationRKPurchaseKitPurchasesManageractiveSubscriptioninGroup-docpurchasekitRKPurchaseKitdocumentationRKPurchaseKitStoreProductsubscriptionGroupID","text":"See: ``doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/activeSubscriptions()``, ``doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/PurchasesManager\/activeSubscription(inGroup:)``, ``doc:\/\/purchasekit.RKPurchaseKit\/documentation\/RKPurchaseKit\/StoreProduct\/subscriptionGroupID``.","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"8-Testing--mocking","text":"8  Testing & mocking"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Depend on PurchasesProtocol in you